Fri Oct 23 18:32:27 UTC 2026 - Martin Pluskal <mpluskal@suse.com>

- Update to version 2026.04.0:
  * Support machine-less builds and machine-specific interfaces
    outside of libmetal
  * NuttX mutex support now handles recursive mutexes
  * CMake no longer propagates PROJECT_EC_FLAGS options to the
    parent project
  * Remove Xilinx BSP code, now maintained in a downstream repo
  * Add public headers to the metal-shared and metal-static CMake
    targets
  * Fix compatibility with AMD machines
  * Provide ATOMIC_VAR_INIT for C23 compilers lacking it
  * Add cross-platform tests, fix documentation and CI issues
- Drop libmetal-gcc15.patch: adopted upstream
- Spec file cleanup

